flowchart TD
  T[Task arrives at lead] --> R{Checkable result?}
  R -- no: divergent reasoning --> C[Claude does it: lead or Claude subagent]
  R -- yes: lead writes check --> S[crew spawn: worktree + branch + pane]
  S --> W[Qwen worker: edit, run check, loop]
  W --> P[Worker commits + short report]
  P --> V{Lead reviews diff, reruns check}
  V -- pass --> M[Merge, crew close]
  V -- fail, attempt 1 --> B[Send back with notes]
  B --> W
  V -- fail, attempt 2 --> E[Escalate: Claude takes over]
  C --> L[(log.jsonl)]
  M --> L
  E --> L
